{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026h7QmihUlTi1793242344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析認為，恒指正陷入弱勢整理格局，反彈動力不足，不排除再下試23,000點。</p><p></p><p>輝立證券董事黃瑋傑表示︰「恒指由上周五至今，仍在23,000點拉鋸。跌穿後也不是跌幅很深，但這在技術走勢上，是弱勢整理格局，於急跌後喘定，但喘定後上升動能不強。擔心很大機會喘息後，若再有利淡因素出來就再跌，若跌穿23,000點，下個支持位就是22,800點。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.196266+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.859568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:24.116490+00:00","content_hash":"483876cbf2e866807ff980c026bb2dd38a8acc8f41ff341799841827e925e32c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.196266+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}